  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1902.10 “Local river management advisory committee (LRMAC)” means a committee established under RSA 483:8-a.\n\nSource. #7901, eff 5-29-03 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1900) (formerly Env-Ws 1902.10); ss by #9936, eff 5-28-11; ss by #12695, eff 12-22-18 (formerly Env-Wq 1902.13)",
